Package: com.goldenappleguy.ythideprogress
Name: YTHideProgress
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Hides YouTube's progress bar while you are not using it: under the video, in the miniplayer, on thumbnails, in picture in picture and in the Lock Screen and Control Center players. Choose the channels it applies to.
Maintainer: GoldenAppleGuy
Author: GoldenAppleGuy
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 14.0)
Icon: https://goldenappleguy.github.io/repo/icons/com.goldenappleguy.ythideprogress.png
